{"title":"Surface","sourceTitle":"Surface/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Surface/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Oberfläche (3% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Surface (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Superficie (3% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Surface (97% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Поверхность (97% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"地表 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Surface/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"地表 (28% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: rgba(120,90,60,0.4); border: 1px solid #7a7c7d; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Sapling-birch.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/64px-Sapling-birch.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/96px-Sapling-birch.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a5/Sapling-birch.png/128px-Sapling-birch.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p><big><b>Este artigo é um esboço.</b></big><br />\nEste artigo não contém tantas informações quanto gostaríamos.\nSe desejar contribuir, você pode solicitar acesso de edição do wiki no <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.vintagestory.at/forums/topic/267-wiki-discussion/\">forum</a> ou no <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Tndr3w8\">Discord</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Native_copper_in_chert.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/55/Native_copper_in_chert.png/300px-Native_copper_in_chert.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/55/Native_copper_in_chert.png/450px-Native_copper_in_chert.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/55/Native_copper_in_chert.png/600px-Native_copper_in_chert.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2560\" data-file-height=\"1440\" /></a><figcaption>Localização regular da superfície</figcaption></figure>\n<p><span id=\"Overview\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Vis.C3.A3o_geral\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visão_geral\">Visão geral</span></h2>\n<p>O mundo percorrível, natureza, luz solar, chuva, natureza e vida.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Visão_geral\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Visão geral</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Explicação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Explicação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Valores_de_altura\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Valores de altura</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Recursos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recursos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Minérios\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Minérios</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Geração_de_minério\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geração de minério</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Forrageamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Forrageamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Animais\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Animais</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Agricultura\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Agricultura</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Ruínas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ruínas</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Explanation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Explica.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Explicação\">Explicação</span></h2>\n<p>O <b>Nível de Superfície</b> é definido como os blocos mais altos que serão afetados pela chuva ou luz solar.\n</p><p><span id=\"Height&#95;Values\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Valores_de_altura\">Valores de altura</span></h3>\n<p>A altura varia dependendo da distância entre o <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mantle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mantle\">Manto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mantle\" title=\"Mantle\"> </a></span> e a Superfície. Ao falar sobre geração e mecânica, o jogo irá calcular seus valores utilizando os seguintes critérios:\n</p>\n<ul><li>A <b>Surface</b> terá uma altura de 1 ou 100%.</li>\n<li>O Manto terá altura de 0 ou 0%.</li></ul>\n<p>Os cálculos não serão baseados em coordenadas ou blocos, mas sim no valor referente à porcentagem definida pelos Valores de Altura anteriores.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><b>Exemplo</b>: Se você está em uma colina com y de 150 e está procurando uma altura de 0,6 ou 60%; você precisará olhar para y90.</dd></dl>\n<p><span id=\"Resources\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recursos\">Recursos</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Ores\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Min.C3.A9rios\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minérios\">Minérios</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal\">Metal</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal\" title=\"Metal\"> </a></span> para informações detalhadas.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Alguns minérios, como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lead\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lead\">Chumbo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lead\" title=\"Lead\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Brown_coal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Brown coal\">Carvão marrom</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Brown_coal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brown coal\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Borax\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Borax\">Bórax</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Borax\" title=\"Borax\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Quartz\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Quartz\">Quartzo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quartz\" title=\"Quartz\"> </a></span> podem ser vistos como pedaços na superfície. Isso indica que um depósito desses minerais está localizado no subsolo.\n</p><p>Colinas e falésias podem expor depósitos de minério devido à natureza da geração do minério.\n</p><p><span id=\"Ore&#95;Generation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\"Gera.C3.A7.C3.A3o_de_min.C3.A9rio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geração_de_minério\">Geração de minério</span></h4>\n<dl><dd><i>Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits#Technical\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits#Technical\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span> para informações detalhadas.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>A geração de minério seguirá a mecânica <b>Height Values</b>. Os valores específicos para minérios podem ser vistos em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ore_Deposits#Shallow_ores\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ore Deposits\">suas próprias mesas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits#Shallow_ores\" title=\"Ore Deposits\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><b>Exemplo</b>: <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Coal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Coal\">Carvão marrom</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal\" title=\"Coal\"> </a></span> é gerado entre os valores de altura 0,48 (48%) e 0,92 (92%), isso significa que, se a distância entre <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mantle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mantle\">Manto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mantle\" title=\"Mantle\"> </a></span> e <b>Surface</b> for de 100 blocos, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Coal\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Coal\">Carvão marrom</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coal\" title=\"Coal\"> </a></span> será gerado entre os blocos y48 e y92 (com base nas coordenadas).</dd></dl>\n<p><span id=\"Foraging\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Forrageamento\">Forrageamento</span></h3>\n<p><span id=\"Animals\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animais\">Animais</span></h3>\n<p>Para sobreviver, os animais precisam de luz. Qualquer pessoa que se aventurar em uma caverna morrerá depois de um tempo se não houver luz presente.\n</p><p><span id=\"Farming\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Agricultura\">Agricultura</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> para informações detalhadas.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>A menos que seja definido na Configuração Mundial, as plantas não podem crescer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Underground_farming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">subterrâneo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Underground_farming\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Ruins\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Ru.C3.ADnas\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ruínas\">Ruínas</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ruin\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ruin\">Ruínas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ruin\" title=\"Ruin\"> </a></span> para informações detalhadas.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Ruínas de estruturas podem ser encontradas na superfície e no subsolo. Eles escondem loot em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/cracked_vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/cracked vessel\">vasos rachados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_vessel\" title=\"Cracked vessel\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bony_soil\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bony soil\">solo com ossos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bony_soil\" title=\"Bony soil\"> </a></span> que você pode cavar e que também pode dar algum loot depois de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Panning\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Panning\">panorâmica</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Panning\" title=\"Panning\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a